{
  "id": "ROM.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Romans 11",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I say then, Did God cast off his people? God forbid. For I also am an Israelite, of the seed of Abraham, of the tribe of Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God did not cast off his people which he foreknew. Or know ye not what the scripture saith of Elijah? how he pleadeth with God against Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lord, they have killed thy prophets, they have digged down thine altars; and I am left alone, and they seek my life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But what saith the answer of God unto him? I have left for myself seven thousand men, who have not bowed the knee to Baal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even so then at this present time also there is a remnant according to the election of grace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if it is by grace, it is no more of works: otherwise grace is no more grace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What then? That which Israel seeketh for, that he obtained not; but the election obtained it, and the rest were hardened: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according as it is written, God gave them a spirit of stupor, eyes that they should not see, and ears that they should not hear, unto this very day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David saith,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I say then, Did they stumble that they might fall? God forbid: but by their fall salvation ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto the Gentiles, to provoke them to jealousy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now if their fall is the riches of the world, and their loss the riches of the Gentiles; how much more their fulness? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I speak to you that are Gentiles. Inasmuch then as I am an apostle of Gentiles, I glorify my ministry; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if by any means I may provoke to jealousy ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " my flesh, and may save some of them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if the casting away of them ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the reconciling of the world, what ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the receiving ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", but life from the dead? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if the firstfruit is holy, so is the lump: and if the root is holy, so are the branches. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if some of the branches were broken off, and thou, being a wild olive, wast grafted in among them, and didst become partaker with them of the root of the fatness of the olive tree; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "glory not over the branches: but if thou gloriest, it is not thou that bearest the root, but the root thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt say then, Branches were broken off, that I might be grafted in. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Well; by their unbelief they were broken off, and thou standest by thy faith. Be not highminded, but fear: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for if God spared not the natural branches, neither will he spare thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold then the goodness and severity of God: toward them that fell, severity; but toward thee, God’s goodness, if thou continue in his goodness: otherwise thou also shalt be cut off. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they also, if they continue not in their unbelief, shall be grafted in: for God is able to graft them in again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if thou wast cut out of that which is by nature a wild olive tree, and wast grafted contrary to nature into a good olive tree; how much more shall these, which are the natural ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", be grafted into their own olive tree?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I would not, brethren, have you ignorant of this mystery, lest ye be wise in your own conceits, that a hardening in part hath befallen Israel, until the fulness of the Gentiles be come in; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and so all Israel shall be saved: even as it is written,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O the depth of the riches both of the wisdom and the knowledge of God! how unsearchable are his judgments, and his ways past tracing out! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For who hath known the mind of the Lord? or who hath been his counsellor? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or who hath first given to him, and it shall be recompensed unto him again? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For of him, and through him, and unto him, are all things. To him ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the glory for ever. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ROM.12",
